From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: naelolaiz <1333555+naelolaiz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:31:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] main/git: xmlto only for the full build

xmlto is only used to build the man pages, which the APKBUILD already
builds only when neither BOOTSTRAP nor APORTS_BOOTSTRAP is set. Move it
into that branch next to asciidoc. When bootstrapping this saves xmlto
and its DocBook, libxslt and libgcrypt chain, about 8 source packages.

The full build gets the same makedepends as before.
Generic, not specific to riscv32.
---
 main/git/APKBUILD | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/main/git/APKBUILD b/main/git/APKBUILD
index f68db687dcf..fedc7845b0e 100644
--- a/main/git/APKBUILD
+++ b/main/git/APKBUILD
@@ -78,7 +78,6 @@ makedepends="
 	pcre2-dev
 	perl-dev
 	perl-error
-	xmlto
 	zlib-dev
 	"
 checkdepends="openssh-client-common openssh-keygen" # force ssh-agent test to run
@@ -112,7 +111,8 @@ _gitcoredir=usr/libexec/git-core
 
 if [ -z "$BOOTSTRAP" ] && [ -z "$APORTS_BOOTSTRAP" ]; then
 	# we need tcl and tk to be built before git due to git-gui and gitk
-	makedepends="$makedepends asciidoc python3-dev tcl tk libsecret-dev glib-dev"
+	# xmlto and asciidoc for the man pages
+	makedepends="$makedepends asciidoc xmlto python3-dev tcl tk libsecret-dev glib-dev"
 	subpackages="$subpackages
 		$pkgname-doc
 		$pkgname-p4::noarch
-- 
